--- !u!114 &520054346
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 520054341}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d69386bbf259070458282b0daae99b17, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    names:
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    lines:
    - It's starting to make sense now.. they're barely a lot of evidence but if I'm
      really correct about this..
    - The severed finger must've belonged to the occupant of this house or should
      I say.. the stranger behind the email..
    - Looking closely at the finger's print with the stamp on the certificate, they
      resemble each other rather.. perfectly..
    - So presumably, this finger must've belonged to.. Buck Channing. That Wanted
      man from TV..
    - But.. out of all people.. why me..?
    - As for the army knife.. there's nothing much to correlate it with the other
      items..
    - Except for the symbol.. engraved on it..
    - ...
    - Wait.. I saw this symbol somewhere..
    - Isn't this.. from the Special Forces? Oh #$%&..
    - If my hunch is correct.. they must've broken in. Buck must've been an army
      veteran. How else could've he managed to fight them off. It's a massacre.
    - Though it did costed him his finger..
    - But.. there are no remains other than the blood. Something doesn't feel right..
    images:
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
