    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    lines:
    - A very vintage electronic device sits on the coffee table.
    - I've never seen anything like this. Must be handmade or something back from
      the 90s.
    - I can fit two batteries in these slots to power it back up.
    - If only I had some..
