  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d69386bbf259070458282b0daae99b17, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    names:
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - 
    - 
    lines:
    - If this were really true.. there must be more than what meets the eye.
    - According to this investigation board, all these clues seem to point towards
      this Old Warehouse not far from here.
    - But before that.. I should make sense of what unravelled before I got here.
    - There must be something in your suitcase that can act as evidence. But what?
    - If you can't make anything out of what your currently have, perhaps you should
      research the house incase of missing important details..
    images:
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
