--- !u!114 &1171540198
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1171540196}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d69386bbf259070458282b0daae99b17, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    names:
    - 
    - 
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    lines:
    - An investigation board filled with marked locations, multiple suspects, and
      various overlooked cases, hangs on the wall.
    - Without even meeting the person behind the anonymous email, this board alone
      seems to have provided you with all the information you needed.
    - ( ponder.. )
    - Are the rumors of those controversial posts really true? People disappearing?
      Soldiers with cybernetic implants?
    - and.. dictatorship over the city.. ?!
    - I was just here for a quick buck but this..
    - What have I gotten myself into..
    - What.. should I do..?
    images:
    - {fileID: -3192516492055939191, guid: 6730911efd719bc48a9da7e5a9bb3f72, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -3192516492055939191, guid: 6730911efd719bc48a9da7e5a9bb3f72, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    choice:
      hasChoice: 1
      option_1_text: Call the police
      option_2_text: Investigate Further
      option_1_desc: I've seen enough. I better hand this over to the authorities..
      option_2_desc: All the proof on this board seems to lead towards something..
      option_1_dialogue: {fileID: 1822735378}
      option_2_dialogue: {fileID: 1142459715}
