MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1708302411}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d69386bbf259070458282b0daae99b17, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    names:
    - Paul
    - 
    - Pinned Note
    - Pinned Note
    - Pinned Note
    - Paul
    lines:
    - A pretty old computer model, even a bit too old to work at this current year
      of age. I'm surprised it's still working.
    - A digital sticky note is pinned on the right bottom of the screen.
    - '"When the lights remains to linger, the small bulb also proceeds to shine."'
    - '"When the lights only flicker, the small bulb can only wish to be divine."'
    - '"When the lights flicker quicker, they wait for the next group of small bulbs
      to follow the sign."'
    - Man.. why riddles at a time like this..
    images:
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -3192516492055939191, guid: 6730911efd719bc48a9da7e5a9bb3f72, type: 3}
