  dialogue:
    names:
    - 
    - 
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    lines:
    - A bookshelf filled with a collection of books on life advice and.. mangas?
    - What looks like a normal bookshelf to the human eye, this one seems rather..
      unusual..
    - This bookshelf seems to be lighter than I anticipated. Perhaps I can move it
      aside.
    - (grunts)
    - With or without the books, it doesn't seem to budge.
    - It seems to be locked to a certain mechanism.
