  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    names:
    - 
    - Paul
    - Paul
    - Paul
    lines:
    - A bookshelf of murder stories (and how to get away with it).
    - Don't tell me I'm walking in the house of a killer..
    - But if I'm thinking positively, this has to be related with those unsolved
      murder cases, especially that one where the office assistant was arrested.
    - Even I did't buy their story. The evidence didn't add up.
    images:
    - {fileID: -3192516492055939191, guid: 6730911efd719bc48a9da7e5a9bb3f72, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3641372603542673665, guid: 17ce39b9e2507af40b9340a67211c236, type: 3}
