  dialogue:
    names:
    - 
    - 
    - Paul
    - Paul
    lines:
    - Presumably the only reliable light source as of now, a tall lamp remains to
      flicker continuously in the corner of the living room.
    - It may just be a poor service of electricity, but there may be more to it..
    - The only thing I see lit up..
    - It can't be a coincidence..
