      propertyPath: 'dialogue.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: An old cellphone model. I haven't seen this model ever since I was like..
        five.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2133591189662482030, guid: 5388f868c0f5c4a47821f24cb386faf0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: Old models like this can definitely go under the radar. Must've been
        used to stay hidden for a long time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2133591189662482030, guid: 5388f868c0f5c4a47821f24cb386faf0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Their batteries are a bit loose too.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2133591189662482030, guid: 5388f868c0f5c4a47821f24cb386faf0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.lines.Array.data[3]'
